graph TD
    A[Cell Wall Stress] --> B{Remodeling Type?}
    B -->|Enzymatic| C[Cellulase Activity]
    B -->|Mechanical| D[Wall Stretching]
    B -->|Chemical| E[Wall Loosening]
    
    C --> F[Cellulose Degradation]
    F --> G[Wall Weakening]
    G --> H[New Material Insertion]
    H --> I[Wall Remodeling Complete]
    
    D --> J[Wall Deformation]
    J --> K[Wall Reinforcement]
    K --> I
    
    E --> L[Wall Modification]
    L --> M[Wall Restructuring]
    M --> I
    
    %% Regulation
    I --> N[Wall Integrity]
    N --> O{Wall Status?}
    O -->|Normal| P[Remodeling Inhibition]
    O -->|Compromised| Q[Remodeling Activation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    R[Cellulases] --> C
    S[Expansins] --> D
    T[Wall Loosening Enzymes] --> E
    U[Wall Proteins] --> H
    V[Wall Reinforcement Proteins] --> K
    W[Wall Modification Enzymes] --> L
    
